{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"story_pinecn_set_2_story_1","storyGroup":"story_pinecn_set_2","storySort":0,"storyDependence":null,"storyCanShow":0,"storyCode":null,"storyName":"从头来过","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"松果误会自己被罗德岛开除后决定组建自己的工程队。误会解除后，她依然决定如此去做，她已经成长为成熟的工人，她有新的路要走。","storyCanEnter":0,"storyTxt":"obt/memory/story_pinecn_2_1","avgTag":"幕间","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":0,"requiredStages":null,"characters":["松果","爱德森","工程部干员A","卡夫卡","工程部干员B","工程部干员C","松果/卡夫卡"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"stopmusic","id":1},{"type":"dialog","text":"","id":2},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_bg_bg_room_2.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":5},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":6},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_normal_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":7,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":8},{"type":"delay","time":"1","text":"","id":9},{"type":"playsound","key":"$dooropenquite","volume":"1","id":10},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":11},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#2$1","duration":"1","id":12},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":13},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果","text":"爱德森，抱、抱歉，我去得迟了，食堂的早餐已经没剩什么了，你将就吃一些。","id":14,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/55/Avg_avg_440_pinecn_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1796_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":15},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱德森","text":"没关系，米娜姐姐。","id":16,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_1796_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1796_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":17},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱德森","text":"对了对了，我的简历你有帮我交吗？罗德岛工程部同意我入职吗？我是不是很快就能和你做同事了？","id":18,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_1796_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#4$1","id":19},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果","text":"我……","id":20,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_440_pinecn_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1796_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":21},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱德森","text":"你怎么了，你的表情看起来很奇怪……","id":22,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_1796_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1796_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":23},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱德森","text":"没、没成？","id":24,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_1796_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#4$1","id":25},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果","text":"……","id":26,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_440_pinecn_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1796_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":27},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱德森","text":"米娜姐姐，你是不是没跟工程部的人说我是你的老乡啊？我是特意来投奔你的，我的履历很清白，不是什么来历不明的家伙！","id":28,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_1796_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1796_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":29},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱德森","text":"我从小跟着父辈在工地上进进出出，砌筑工钢筋工测量工架子工……什么类型的活我都能干，罗德岛可以无偿测试我一段时间的……","id":30,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_1796_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#1$1","id":31},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果","text":"爱德森，过两天，我们一起回哥伦比亚。","id":32,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_440_pinecn_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1796_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":33},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱德森","text":"一起？","id":34,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_1796_1$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":35},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#4$1","id":36},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果","text":"呜……我也被开除了。","id":37,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_440_pinecn_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":38},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":39},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":40},{"type":"charslot","id":41},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","keep":"true","fadetime":"0","amount":"0.7","id":42},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_bg_bg_corridor.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":43},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":44},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":45},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":46},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$darkness01_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_darkness01_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","text":"","id":47,"musicid":1},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_970_1#1$1","id":48},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工程部干员A","text":"……","id":49,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b9/Avg_avg_npc_970_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_214_kafka_1#2$1","id":50},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡夫卡","text":"……","id":51,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_214_kafka_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_970_1#1$1","id":52},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工程部干员A","text":"所以……松果需要离开罗德岛。","id":53,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b9/Avg_avg_npc_970_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_214_kafka_1#2$1","id":54},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡夫卡","text":"什么时候？","id":55,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_214_kafka_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_970_1#1$1","id":56},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工程部干员A","text":"越快越好吧。","id":57,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b9/Avg_avg_npc_970_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_214_kafka_1#2$1","id":58},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡夫卡","text":"没得商量？","id":59,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_214_kafka_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_970_1#1$1","id":60},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工程部干员A","text":"没得商量。","id":61,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b9/Avg_avg_npc_970_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":62},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":63},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.7","block":"true","id":64},{"type":"charslot","id":65},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#3$1","id":66},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":67},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.7","block":"true","id":68},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":69},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#3$1","id":70},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"12","vibrato":"30","randomness":"120","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":71},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果","text":"——！","id":72,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/05/Avg_avg_440_pinecn_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":73},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"2","amount":"0","block":"false","id":74},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_bg_bg_room_2.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":75},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":76},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#4$1","id":77},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果","text":"呜……","id":78,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_440_pinecn_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1796_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":79},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱德森","text":"可、可是，他们为什么这么对你？","id":80,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_1796_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1796_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":81},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱德森","text":"你经常寄信回家，你的爸爸会把信给我们看，你每次不都说从来没想过会遇见罗德岛这样的公司吗？福利待遇好，也很有人情味……","id":82,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_1796_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#4$1","id":83},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果","text":"可罗德岛毕竟只是一家公司啊。","id":84,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_440_pinecn_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#4$1","id":85},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果","text":"公司有需要员工的时候，就总会有不需要员工的时候……在哥伦比亚，我们见过很多这样的事情。","id":86,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_440_pinecn_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#2$1","id":87},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果","text":"（擦眼泪）好了，爱德森，你记得吃早餐，我要先去工作了。舰桥检修的工期很紧张，工程部今天有的忙呢。","id":88,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/55/Avg_avg_440_pinecn_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1796_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":89},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱德森","text":"米娜姐姐，他们都这样对你了，你还要跟个没事人一样……","id":90,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_1796_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#2$1","id":91},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果","text":"罗德岛之前并没有亏待我啊。","id":92,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/55/Avg_avg_440_pinecn_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#7$1","id":93},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果","text":"而且，属于我的工作，必须要做完的。","id":94,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_440_pinecn_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#7$1","id":95},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果","text":"再说我也想找卡夫卡问问清楚……","id":96,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_440_pinecn_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":97},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":98},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":99},{"type":"charslot","id":100},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ef/Avg_bg_bg_bridge.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":101},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":102},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":103},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":104},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#3$1","id":105},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果","text":"卡夫卡！","id":106,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/05/Avg_avg_440_pinecn_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":107},{"type":"charslot","id":108},{"type":"playsound","key":"$drift","volume":"0.2","id":109},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_214_kafka_1#3$1","duration":"0.6","id":110},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":111},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡夫卡","text":"嘿，米娜！","id":112,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e8/Avg_avg_214_kafka_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_214_kafka_1#3$1","id":113},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡夫卡","text":"你怎么眼睛红红的，没睡好？打起精神来……啊，我有点事要去找酸糖，先走了先走了。","id":114,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e8/Avg_avg_214_kafka_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#5$1","id":115},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果","text":"你、你……","id":116,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/91/Avg_avg_440_pinecn_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_214_kafka_1#7$1","id":117},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡夫卡","text":"怎么了？","id":118,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/03/Avg_avg_214_kafka_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#4$1","id":119},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果","text":"你没有什么话想跟我说吗？","id":120,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_440_pinecn_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_214_kafka_1#9$1","id":121},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡夫卡","text":"唔，米娜，晚一些好吗？再给我一点时间……","id":122,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dc/Avg_avg_214_kafka_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#4$1","id":123},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果","text":"其实你不用担心我——","id":124,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_440_pinecn_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":125},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_214_kafka_1#1$1","id":126},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":127},{"type":"playsound","key":"$drift","volume":"0.2","id":128},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.5","id":129},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":130},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#3$1","id":131},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果","text":"……","id":132,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/05/Avg_avg_440_pinecn_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_970_1#1$1","id":133},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工程部干员A","text":"嘿，松果，别愣在那儿了。","id":134,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b9/Avg_avg_npc_970_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#2$1","id":135},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果","text":"来了来了。","id":136,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/55/Avg_avg_440_pinecn_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_970_1#1$1","id":137},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工程部干员A","text":"你光拎着一把钉枪就过来了啊，又把工具包忘在宿舍了？","id":138,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b9/Avg_avg_npc_970_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#4$1","id":139},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果","text":"啊，对不起，我……","id":140,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_440_pinecn_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#4$1","id":141},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果","text":"出门的时候分神了。","id":142,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_440_pinecn_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_970_1#1$1","id":143},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工程部干员A","text":"这可不是第一回了哦。","id":144,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b9/Avg_avg_npc_970_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_970_1#1$1","id":145},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工程部干员A","text":"上周你把备用电池落在了训练场的施工区，等到训练场快要关闭的时候才发现，整艘船的人都看着你气喘吁吁地折返跑……","id":146,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b9/Avg_avg_npc_970_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_970_1#1$1","id":147},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工程部干员A","text":"一桩桩一件件，我们可都记得哦！","id":148,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b9/Avg_avg_npc_970_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#8$1","id":149},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果","text":"（是因为这个……）","id":150,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/19/Avg_avg_440_pinecn_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#4$1","id":151},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果","text":"（米娜，谁会喜欢总丢三落四的人呢……）","id":152,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_440_pinecn_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_970_1#1$1","id":153},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工程部干员A","text":"好了，先用我的工具包吧。","id":154,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b9/Avg_avg_npc_970_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_970_1#1$1","id":155},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工程部干员A","text":"确认一下任务日志，你负责左边的区域，我负责右边，今天之内得完成对舰桥的整体检修。","id":156,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b9/Avg_avg_npc_970_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#3$1","id":157},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果","text":"前辈，为什么这么急？","id":158,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/05/Avg_avg_440_pinecn_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_970_1#1$1","id":159},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工程部干员A","text":"之后，我们还需要对中层甲板、下层甲板，以及舰载天灾预警系统和开采模块等重要区域进行检修，为全舰拆分做尽可能多的准备。","id":160,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b9/Avg_avg_npc_970_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#3$1","id":161},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果","text":"全、全舰拆分？","id":162,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/05/Avg_avg_440_pinecn_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#3$1","id":163},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果","text":"是说整艘陆行舰都要……","id":164,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/05/Avg_avg_440_pinecn_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#3$1","id":165},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果","text":"就说大家最近看起来那么忙碌……","id":166,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/05/Avg_avg_440_pinecn_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_970_1#1$1","id":167},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工程部干员A","text":"你在想什么？","id":168,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b9/Avg_avg_npc_970_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#2$1","id":169},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果","text":"前辈，我能理解。","id":170,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/55/Avg_avg_440_pinecn_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#2$1","id":171},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果","text":"小时候爸爸跟我说，哥伦比亚每天都有无数家新公司、无数支新工程队诞生，但它们的总数其实一直都没怎么变过……","id":172,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/55/Avg_avg_440_pinecn_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#2$1","id":173},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果","text":"当时我不懂那些话是什么意思，后来我长大了，自己开始在一个又一个工程队之间辗转，看得多了，也就明白了。","id":174,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/55/Avg_avg_440_pinecn_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#2$1","id":175},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果","text":"大地是无情的，公司和人一样脆弱。","id":176,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/55/Avg_avg_440_pinecn_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_970_1#1$1","id":177},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工程部干员A","text":"这话怎么听着那么奇怪……算了我也解释不清楚。工程部接到指令也没多久，好好干完这最后的活吧，松果。","id":178,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b9/Avg_avg_npc_970_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_970_1#1$1","id":179},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工程部干员A","text":"对了，今天下班后记得去工程部核对任务日志。","id":180,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b9/Avg_avg_npc_970_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#7$1","id":181},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果","text":"……","id":182,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_440_pinecn_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#7$1","id":183},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果","text":"难怪要遣散员工……罗德岛，这么好的公司……","id":184,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_440_pinecn_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#8$1","id":185},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果","text":"可是，米娜，你又能做什么呢……","id":186,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/19/Avg_avg_440_pinecn_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":187},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":188},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":189},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":190},{"type":"charslot","id":191},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/05/Avg_bg_bg_rhodesengineeringroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":192},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":193},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":194},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":195},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$drift_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_drift_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":196,"musicid":2},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":197},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":198},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":199},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果","text":"您好，舰桥检修完毕，我来汇总并核对这段时间的任务日志。","id":200,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_440_pinecn_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_971_1#1$1","id":201},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工程部干员B","text":"啊，松果干员，稍等片刻可以吗，容我们处理完手头的工作？","id":202,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_avg_npc_971_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#1$1","id":203},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果","text":"……好。","id":204,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_440_pinecn_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_971_1#1$1","id":205},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工程部干员B","text":"这些是全部了吗？","id":206,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_avg_npc_971_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_972_1#1$1","id":207},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工程部干员C","text":"嗯。","id":208,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_npc_972_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_971_1#1$1","id":209},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工程部干员B","text":"我看看……","id":210,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_avg_npc_971_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_971_1#1$1","id":211},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工程部干员B","text":"哥伦比亚烟酒施术单元以及源石制品管理局的审批公函，罗德岛与莱茵生命等企业在医药、能源等领域的业务合作都逐一登记在案。","id":212,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_avg_npc_971_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_971_1#1$1","id":213},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工程部干员B","text":"最厚的这叠文件，是和雷姆必拓相关的……罗德岛以工程部和干员个人名义在雷姆必拓参与过数十次高难度开采作业。","id":214,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_avg_npc_971_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_971_1#1$1","id":215},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工程部干员B","text":"维多利亚的在这边……莱塔尼亚……卡西米尔……","id":216,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_avg_npc_971_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_972_1#1$1","id":217},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工程部干员C","text":"说起来，全舰从检修到拆分，这可能是工程部有史以来最忙的时候，我们真的不去帮其他人，而是在这里整理旧文件吗？","id":218,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_npc_972_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_971_1#1$1","id":219},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工程部干员B","text":"这也是同等重要的工作啊，朋友。","id":220,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_avg_npc_971_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_972_1#1$1","id":221},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工程部干员C","text":"可能吧……","id":222,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_npc_972_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_971_1#1$1","id":223},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工程部干员B","text":"本舰拆分之后，罗德岛在各地的办事处就要忙碌起来了。","id":224,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_avg_npc_971_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_971_1#1$1","id":225},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工程部干员B","text":"这些旧文件，可不仅仅是我们去过哪些地方、做过哪些事情的纪念。","id":226,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_avg_npc_971_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_971_1#1$1","id":227},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工程部干员B","text":"它们是给别人看的，也是给我们自己看的……它们能向所有人证明，我们能做到什么。","id":228,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_avg_npc_971_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_972_1#1$1","id":229},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工程部干员C","text":"……也是。","id":230,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_npc_972_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#1$1","id":231},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果","text":"……","id":232,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_440_pinecn_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":233},{"type":"charslot","id":234},{"type":"playsound","key":"$keyboard","volume":"1","id":235},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":236},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_972_1#1$1","id":237},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工程部干员C","text":"啊，松果干员，你的任务日志我这边已经确认了。","id":238,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_npc_972_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#2$1","id":239},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果","text":"谢谢。","id":240,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/55/Avg_avg_440_pinecn_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#2$1","id":241},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果","text":"那个，我……能麻烦您帮个忙吗？","id":242,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/55/Avg_avg_440_pinecn_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_972_1#1$1","id":243},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工程部干员C","text":"怎么了？","id":244,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_npc_972_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#2$1","id":245},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果","text":"我想调取自己入职后的全部任务记录。","id":246,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/55/Avg_avg_440_pinecn_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":247},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":248},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":249},{"type":"charslot","id":250},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_bg_bg_room_2.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":251},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":252},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":253},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":254},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1796_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":255},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱德森","text":"米娜姐姐，你终于回来了。","id":256,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_1796_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#1$1","id":257},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果","text":"嗯嗯。","id":258,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_440_pinecn_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1796_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":259},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱德森","text":"你有去找他们要个说法吗？","id":260,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_1796_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#8$1","id":261},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果","text":"没有。","id":262,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/19/Avg_avg_440_pinecn_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#2$1","id":263},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果","text":"爱德森，发生了一些事情，我、我不知道该怎么解释……","id":264,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/55/Avg_avg_440_pinecn_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1796_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":265},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱德森","text":"那你怎么办，我们怎么办？","id":266,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_1796_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#7$1","id":267},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果","text":"……","id":268,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_440_pinecn_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1796_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":269},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱德森","text":"我一直觉得你很厉害，米娜姐姐。","id":270,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_1796_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1796_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":271},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱德森","text":"你爸爸出事，家里发生了那么大的变故，你都挺过来了。我听说当年你甚至去曼斯菲尔德监狱帮助了西蒙家的大少爷……","id":272,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_1796_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1796_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":273},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱德森","text":"后来你被迫离开了家乡，来到这么远的地方，可你依然找到了一份很不错的工作。可最终，你还是只能就这么回哥伦比亚吗？","id":274,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_1796_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1796_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":275},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱德森","text":"因为拓荒规划，咱们的镇子被迫搬得离移动城市更远了，活路本来就很难找。加上当年你爸爸和西蒙家大少爷的事情……","id":276,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_1796_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#7$1","id":277},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果","text":"那些和我们打过交道的工头和老板们，指不定还要怎么使绊子。","id":278,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_440_pinecn_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#7$1","id":279},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果","text":"……这些我都知道的。","id":280,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_440_pinecn_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1796_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":281},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱德森","text":"难道你真的要一个工地一个工地找过去，一个人一个人地求过去吗？","id":282,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_1796_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#2$1","id":283},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果","text":"……","id":284,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/55/Avg_avg_440_pinecn_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":285},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_paper2","volume":"1","id":286},{"type":"delay","time":"0.51","id":287},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1796_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":288},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱德森","text":"米娜姐姐，你有没有听我说话？","id":289,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_1796_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#1$1","id":290},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果","text":"唔……","id":291,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_440_pinecn_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1796_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":292},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱德森","text":"你手里拿的是什么啊？回来之后，你就一直在翻……","id":293,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_1796_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#1$1","id":294},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果","text":"我入职以来的全部任务记录。","id":295,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_440_pinecn_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":296},{"type":"text","text":"一千三百七十二项任务记录。","id":297},{"type":"text","text":"事故率：百分之零点七。","id":298},{"type":"text","text":"超标准完工率：百分之四十二。","id":299},{"type":"text","text":"……","id":300},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#1$1","id":301},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果","text":"三年又九个月……","id":302,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_440_pinecn_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#8$1","id":303},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果","text":"原来，已经过了这么长的时间了啊……","id":304,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/19/Avg_avg_440_pinecn_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#8$1","id":305},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果","text":"原来，我已经做过这么多的事情……","id":306,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/19/Avg_avg_440_pinecn_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#9$1","id":307},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果","text":"爱德森，不会发生那样的事。","id":308,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/41/Avg_avg_440_pinecn_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1796_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":309},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱德森","text":"米娜姐姐，你说什么？","id":310,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_1796_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#9$1","id":311},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果","text":"我或许会带着你回哥伦比亚，哥伦比亚或许也还是我离开时的那副样子，但你刚刚担心的那些事情……我不会让它们发生的。","id":312,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/41/Avg_avg_440_pinecn_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#1$1","id":313},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果","text":"但我要先去找一个人。","id":314,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_440_pinecn_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":315},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"0.9","id":316},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":317},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":318},{"type":"dialog","id":319},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":320},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":321},{"type":"charslot","id":322},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/de/Avg_bg_bg_corridor_3.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":323},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":324},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":325},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":326},{"type":"dialog","id":327},{"type":"charslot","id":328},{"type":"playsound","key":"$drift","volume":"0.2","id":329},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_214_kafka_1#2$1","posfrom":"30,0","posto":"-30,0","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"0.6","id":330},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":331},{"type":"dialog","id":332},{"type":"charslot","id":333},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"0.9","id":334},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#2$1","posfrom":"-30,0","posto":"30,0","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"0.6","id":335},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":336},{"type":"charslot","id":337},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"1","id":338},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":339},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"1","id":340},{"type":"playsound","key":"$fightgeneral","volume":"1","text":"","id":341},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"50","ystrength":"50","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":342},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"false","id":343},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":344},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_214_kafka_1#3$1","duration":"1","id":345},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":346},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡夫卡","text":"啊，米娜米娜，我正要去你的宿舍呢！","id":347,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e8/Avg_avg_214_kafka_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":348},{"type":"dialog","id":349},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#3$1","duration":"1","id":350},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":351},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果","text":"呼~卡夫卡，我正要找你。","id":352,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/05/Avg_avg_440_pinecn_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":353},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#2$1","focus":"all","id":354},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_214_kafka_1#2$1","focus":"all","id":355},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果/卡夫卡","text":"你听我说。","id":356},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#2$1","focus":"all","id":357},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_214_kafka_1#5$1","focus":"all","id":358},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果/卡夫卡","text":"卡夫卡，我知道你是担心我，不知道该怎么开这个口。/米娜，我确实有点不好意思，不知道怎么开这个口。","id":359},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#1$1","focus":"all","id":360},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_214_kafka_1#2$1","focus":"all","id":361},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果/卡夫卡","text":"我其实已经知道了。公司遣散员工，我见过很多也经历过很多。/在酸糖教我玩滑板之前，我不知道这玩意这么有意思。","id":362},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#1$1","focus":"all","id":363},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_214_kafka_1#2$1","focus":"all","id":364},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果/卡夫卡","text":"大个子介绍我来这里时，我只是想找一份稳定的工作。/它对于街头上长大的孩子来说，就是警察的弩，上班族的咖啡。","id":365},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#1$1","focus":"all","id":366},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_214_kafka_1#7$1","focus":"all","id":367},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果/卡夫卡","text":"最开始我也只能作为助手，在工程部给前辈们打打下手……/酸糖说过两天有个最高规格的滑板比赛，全泰拉的高手聚在一起炫技定榜。","id":368},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#1$1","focus":"all","id":369},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_214_kafka_1#2$1","focus":"all","id":370},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果/卡夫卡","text":"罗德岛是一家很好的公司，也是一个很好的家，它改变了我很多。/毫无疑问，这种比赛将改变我这种新手的一生。","id":371},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#1$1","focus":"all","id":372},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_214_kafka_1#7$1","focus":"all","id":373},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果/卡夫卡","text":"三年多过去，我还是会出门的时候忘了带工具包……/但是工程部交给咱们俩的任务确实也很紧急。","id":374},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#1$1","focus":"all","id":375},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_214_kafka_1#7$1","focus":"all","id":376},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果/卡夫卡","text":"但我的职衔其实变过很多次，我早就在独立负责很多事情了。/我们要尽快赶到罗德岛驻哥伦比亚办事处……","id":377},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#1$1","focus":"all","id":378},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_214_kafka_1#2$1","focus":"all","id":379},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.6","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"12","vibrato":"30","randomness":"120","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":380},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果/卡夫卡","text":"卡夫卡，米娜早就是一个成熟的大人，成熟的工人了！/帮助罗德岛在当地组建一支自己的工程队，以应对未来可能的情况。","id":381},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#1$1","focus":"all","id":382},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_214_kafka_1#9$1","focus":"all","id":383},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果/卡夫卡","text":"成熟的大人不怕离开家，成熟的工人不怕在荒野里创造活路。/我纠结了大半天，米娜，可能得辛苦你一个人先动身。","id":384},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#5$1","focus":"all","id":385},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_214_kafka_1#4$1","focus":"all","id":386},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.6","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"12","vibrato":"30","randomness":"120","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":387},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果/卡夫卡","text":"我决定回到哥伦比亚，拉起一支自己的工程队！/但我最多迟一周就赶回哥伦比亚帮你！","id":388},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#5$1","focus":"all","id":389},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_214_kafka_1#4$1","focus":"all","id":390},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.7","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"12","vibrato":"30","randomness":"120","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":391},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果/卡夫卡","text":"等到时机成熟的时候，说不定我还能回过头来帮罗德岛渡过危机！/所以这几天，你就代表了罗德岛工程部！","id":392},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#6$1","focus":"all","id":393},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_214_kafka_1#4$1","focus":"all","id":394},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.6","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"12","vibrato":"30","randomness":"120","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":395},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果/卡夫卡","text":"我有这个能力！/你有这个能、力！","id":396},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#3$1","focus":"all","id":397},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_214_kafka_1#6$1","focus":"all","id":398},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果/卡夫卡","text":"……","id":399},{"type":"charslot","id":400},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#3$1","id":401},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果","text":"办事处……工程队……啊？","id":402,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/05/Avg_avg_440_pinecn_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_214_kafka_1#9$1","id":403},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡夫卡","text":"等等，米娜，你是不是误会什么了？","id":404,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dc/Avg_avg_214_kafka_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#2$1","id":405},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果","text":"上午在中层甲板的走廊，我听见你和工程部的前辈……","id":406,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/55/Avg_avg_440_pinecn_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_214_kafka_1#9$1","id":407},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡夫卡","text":"……","id":408,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dc/Avg_avg_214_kafka_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":409},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":410},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":411},{"type":"charslot","id":412},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","keep":"true","fadetime":"0","amount":"0.7","id":413},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_bg_bg_corridor.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":414},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":415},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":416},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_normal_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":417,"musicid":3},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":418},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_970_1#1$1","id":419},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工程部干员A","text":"之前跟你说过，接下来罗德岛会加速推进各地办事处的工作。你们来自哥伦比亚，也熟悉那股拓荒的热潮，就当出个长期外勤……","id":420,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b9/Avg_avg_npc_970_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_214_kafka_1#6$1","id":421},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡夫卡","text":"我明白啦。","id":422,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/ff/Avg_avg_214_kafka_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_970_1#1$1","id":423},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工程部干员A","text":"所以，你和松果需要离开罗德岛。","id":424,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b9/Avg_avg_npc_970_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_214_kafka_1#2$1","id":425},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡夫卡","text":"什么时候？","id":426,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_214_kafka_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_970_1#1$1","id":427},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工程部干员A","text":"越快越好吧。","id":428,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b9/Avg_avg_npc_970_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_214_kafka_1#2$1","id":429},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡夫卡","text":"没得商量？","id":430,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_214_kafka_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_970_1#1$1","id":431},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工程部干员A","text":"没得商量。","id":432,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b9/Avg_avg_npc_970_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_214_kafka_1#2$1","id":433},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡夫卡","text":"……","id":434,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_214_kafka_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_970_1#1$1","id":435},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工程部干员A","text":"滑板比赛的事情，我理解啦，我自己还是滑翔伞爱好者，我倒是也相信松果能独立处理前期的各种事情……","id":436,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b9/Avg_avg_npc_970_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_970_1#1$1","id":437},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工程部干员A","text":"这样吧，你和酸糖比一场滑板，你能从她手里赢下三分，我就承认你参加接下来那场比赛的必要性。","id":438,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b9/Avg_avg_npc_970_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_970_1#1$1","id":439},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工程部干员A","text":"以及……","id":440,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b9/Avg_avg_npc_970_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_214_kafka_1#6$1","id":441},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡夫卡","text":"以及，我必须自己说服松果。","id":442,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/ff/Avg_avg_214_kafka_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":443},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":444},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":445},{"type":"charslot","id":446},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","amount":"0","block":"true","id":447},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/de/Avg_bg_bg_corridor_3.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":448},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":449},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":450},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":451},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#1$1","id":452},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果","text":"……","id":453,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_440_pinecn_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_214_kafka_1#9$1","id":454},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡夫卡","text":"……","id":455,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dc/Avg_avg_214_kafka_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#11$1","id":456},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果","text":"所以，你从酸糖姐姐手里赢下三分了吗？","id":457,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ea/Avg_avg_440_pinecn_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_214_kafka_1#4$1","id":458},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡夫卡","text":"我赢了四、分！","id":459,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_214_kafka_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_214_kafka_1#5$1","id":460},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡夫卡","text":"真是抱歉啊，米娜，造成了这么大的误会，让你这么难过……","id":461,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_214_kafka_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#2$1","id":462},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果","text":"没、没关系。我也没有难过……","id":463,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/55/Avg_avg_440_pinecn_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#1$1","id":464},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果","text":"可能我是个比较笨的人吧，来罗德岛第四个年头了，除了偶尔给爸爸写信，我很少会去想自己现在是什么样子的……","id":465,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_440_pinecn_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#1$1","id":466},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果","text":"安全帽、钉枪、工具包、软软的枕头……上工、吃饭、睡觉、领工资、偶尔和大家在甲板上唱歌……生活好像没有变化。","id":467,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_440_pinecn_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#9$1","id":468},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果","text":"但其实，其实……我早就不一样了……啊，是很好的那种。","id":469,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/41/Avg_avg_440_pinecn_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_214_kafka_1#3$1","id":470},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡夫卡","text":"说起来，认识这么久，我好像还是第一次听你一口气说这么多话……","id":471,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e8/Avg_avg_214_kafka_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#11$1","id":472},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果","text":"唔，有、有吗？","id":473,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ea/Avg_avg_440_pinecn_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_214_kafka_1#1$1","id":474},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡夫卡","text":"嗯……不重要。","id":475,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/52/Avg_avg_214_kafka_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#1$1","id":476},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果","text":"卡夫卡，今天的事，虽然说不上来怎么回事，但好像……好像结果是一样的？","id":477,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_440_pinecn_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#2$1","id":478},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果","text":"我会带着爱德森先回哥伦比亚办事处报到。然后我想要回老家的镇子一趟，看看爸爸……那里说不定也会有我们需要的人。","id":479,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/55/Avg_avg_440_pinecn_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_440_pinecn_1#2$1","id":480},{"type":"dialogue","name":"松果","text":"你去跟工程部的前辈汇报吧，你说服了我。","id":481,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/55/Avg_avg_440_pinecn_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_214_kafka_1#8$1","id":482},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡夫卡","text":"……是你说服了我，米娜。","id":483,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a0/Avg_avg_214_kafka_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":484},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":485},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":486},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":487},{"type":"character","id":488},{"type":"charslot","id":489},{"type":"image","id":490}],"characters":["松果","爱德森","工程部干员A","卡夫卡","工程部干员B","工程部干员C","松果/卡夫卡"]}